<title>NORWAY: Norsk Hydro, Elf in Heimdal gas agreemen.</title>
<headline>Norsk Hydro, Elf in Heimdal gas agreemen.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norsk Hydro and Elf Norge have agreed to cooperate to find ways of further using the Heimdal gas installation after the field's reserves have been depleted in 1999, the companies said on Friday.</p>
<p>Elf will transfer 15 percent of its interest in production licence 036 -- the Heimdal licence -- to Hydro, which will become operator.</p>
<p>This will put Hydro's interest in the Heimdal platform at 15.803 percent, while Elf will hold 11.939 percent. In the licence, Hydro will have a 21.920 percent stake and Elf 18.702.</p>
</text>
